5,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"Hi everyone! I'm excited to get started. To make sure the new system actually works for the people on the ground, I want to check the Depot calendar and the peak-season cutover, and Yard devices and the 2021 scheduling trial.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,"I agree that operational stability is key, Kenji. For my part, I want to look into the Board minutes on capital and operating requests and the five years of renewal invoices.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Asuka,,I want to ensure we have clear accountability and a sustainable plan. I'll look into support ownership during last winter's outage and warehouse rule changes after new accounts.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Rin,,I want to see if things are just getting old or if we're fixing the same mistakes! I'll check the upgrade history of the dispatch tool and the data lift in the 2018 pay move.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Servas,,"It is a pleasure to be here with you all. To ensure our people are supported through this transition, I will look into administrator retirements and hiring times, and depot supervisors and the last rollout.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Kenji,,That sounds like a great spread of topics! It feels like we're covering everything from the boardroom to the warehouse floor. I'm curious to see what you all find. Does anyone else think we missed anything?,"{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"I believe we have a comprehensive list. By covering financial records, technical history, and personnel management, we can evaluate the vendors from every necessary angle. I'm satisfied with this distribution.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"I agree. The current selection covers the financial, operational, and human elements of the transition. There is no need to add more; we should proceed to the investigation phase.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Rin,,I'm super excited! I bet we'll find some really juicy secrets in those old files. Let's get to it and see who's actually doing a good job!,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Servas,,"Patience is a virtue, and a thorough search is the foundation of a wise decision. I believe we have a balanced approach. Let us move forward with a spirit of cooperation and openness.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Kenji,,I'm totally on board! I can't wait to see if those yard devices from 2021 actually held up. Let's dive in and find the best partner for our team!,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,"Since we are all in agreement, there is no need for further deliberation this round. I look forward to reviewing the findings and analyzing how they impact our long-term costs.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,pass,Asuka,,Skip,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Rin,,Me too! I'm going to look for clues like a detective! I hope the dispatch tool hasn't just been gathering dust for years. Let's go!,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Servas,,"The energy of youth is a wonderful thing to behold. Let us carry this enthusiasm into our research, keeping in mind that the heart of any system is the people who breathe life into it.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Kenji,,I'm ready! Let's all do our best to find the right answers. I'll see you all in the next round with the results!,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
